=== a word-defined hook that leaves a value ===
PASS: the defining code's stack is put back
=== a word-defined hook that swaps a value below its argument ===
PASS: the consumed value is put back
=== a word-defined hook that raises partway ===
PASS: the partial state is discarded
=== a module-loaded hook that leaves a value ===
PASS: the loading code's stack is put back
